{"speciesId":398,"names":{"fr":"Étouraptor","es":"Staraptor","en":"Staraptor","ja":"ムクホーク"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It has a savage nature. It will courageously challenge foes that are much larger."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"The muscles in its wings and legs are strong. It can easily fly while gripping a small Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It never stops attacking even if it is injured. It fusses over the shape of its comb."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"When STARAVIA evolve into STARAPTOR, they leave the flock to live alone. They have sturdy wings."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"When STARAVIA evolve into STARAPTOR, they leave the flock to live alone. They have sturdy wings."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il combattra sans relâche, même blessé. Il prend grand soin de sa mèche."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It never stops attacking even if it is injured. It fusses over the shape of its comb."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il combattra sans relâche, même blessé. Il prend grand soin de sa mèche."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It never stops attacking even if it is injured. It fusses over the shape of its comb."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It never stops attacking even if it is injured. It fusses over the shape of its comb."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It never stops attacking even if it is injured. It fusses over the shape of its comb."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses ailes et ses pattes ont des muscles développés. Il peut voler en agrippant un petit Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Sus alas y sus patas son muy fuertes. Puede llevarse volando Pokémon pequeños."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The muscles in its wings and legs are strong. It can easily fly while gripping a small Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text